OL,3,AScientist killed in rail crash was 'a
OL,4,Alight for all of us'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe aunt of a University of Cambridge
OL,7,Fscientist killed in the Spanish rail
OL,8,Fdisaster has paid an emotional tribute,
OL,9,Fdescribing her niece as "a light for
OL,10,Fall of us".
OL,12,FDr Marta Shahbazi was travelling to
OL,13,Fcollect a prize for scientific
OL,14,Fexcellence in Andalusia on 28 October,
OL,15,Fwhen her train crashed into another
OL,16,Fnear Urda, south of Madrid, killing 69
OL,17,Fpeople.
OL,19,FMaria Jose Alonso told the BBC a
OL,20,Ffuneral had been held in Madrid on
OL,21,FMonday for the mother of two.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
