OL,3,AScientist killed in rail crash was 'a
OL,4,Alight for all of us'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Hundreds of friends came from all over
OL,7,Fthe world... because Marta was an
OL,8,Famazing lab mate and amazing friend,"
OL,9,Fshe said. "She was the friendliest
OL,10,Fperson you can imagine, with lots of
OL,11,Fenergy. She was a light for all of us."
